### 方案二：VBA 脚本集成（开发者）

如果你希望**完全自定义** AI 功能，可以通过 Word 的 VBA 直接调用 DeepSeek API：

```vba
Function CallDeepSeekAPI(prompt As String) As String
    Dim http As Object
    Set http = CreateObject("MSXML2.XMLHTTP")
    Dim apiUrl As String
    apiUrl = "https://api.deepseek.com/v1/chat/completions"  ' 更新为新版接口
    
    Dim payload As String
    payload = "{""model"":""deepseek-chat"",""messages"":[{""role"":""user"",""content"":""" & prompt & """}]}"
    
    With http
        .Open "POST", apiUrl, False
        .setRequestHeader "Content-Type", "application/json"
        .setRequestHeader "Authorization", "Bearer " & Environ("DEEPSEEK_API_KEY")
        .send payload
        
        If .Status = 200 Then
            ' 解析 JSON 响应
            Dim response As Object
            Set response = JsonConverter.ParseJson(.responseText)
            CallDeepSeekAPI = response("choices")(1)("message")("content")
        Else
            MsgBox "API调用失败: " & .Status
        End If
    End With
End Function
```

> 将上述代码保存在 Word 的 VBA 模块中，即可在文档中调用 `CallDeepSeekAPI("帮我润色这段文字")`。

